ent-SojournMobSamak = samak
    .desc = A tough, armoured predator accustomed to hiding and ambushing in cold terrain.
ent-SojournMobDiyaab = diyaab
    .desc = A small pack animal. Although omnivorous, it will hunt meat on occasion.
ent-SojournMobShantak = shantak
    .desc = A piglike creature with a bright iridescent mane that sparkles as though lit by an inner light. Don't be fooled by its beauty though.
ent-SojournMobViper = viper
    .desc = A ferocious, fang-bearing creature that resembles a snake. Rather calm, unless you get close.
ent-SojournMobTengoloBrute = tengolo brute
    .desc = One of the local fauna native to the planet, peaceful except around insects and insectile creatures. This is one of the males, it looks like a four-eyed monkey mixed with a warthog.
ent-SojournMobTengoloStalker = tengolo stalker
    .desc = One of the local fauna native to the planet, peaceful except around insects and insectile creatures. This is one of the males, it looks like a large cat-like creature.
ent-SojournMobTengoloCharger = tengolo charger
    .desc = One of the local fauna native to the planet, peaceful except around insects and insectile creatures. This is one of the females, it looks like an elk mixed with a warthog.
ent-SojournMobHellDiver = hell diver
    .desc = One of the local fauna native to the planet, nicknamed hell diver by lonestar miners. They tend to rush after hostile life before a miner can see it, and are quite skilled at killing hostile fauna, more than their small size suggests.
ent-SojournMobHakhma = hakhma beetle
    .desc = One of the local fauna native to the planet, a large ornery beetle who doesn't get along with anything but roaches. Mostly peaceful, unless you give it a reason to be hostile.
ent-SojournMobTahca = tahca
    .desc = A cervine creature, surprisingly native to this planet, that resembles a two-headed deer. Despite what one would expect, while docile in nature, it is more than willing to fight if attacked.
ent-SojournMobGiantSnake = giant snake
    .desc = An absolutely gigantic snake.
ent-SojournMobRender = primal render
    .desc = A hulking monster out of a living nightmare. Its powerful hide can shrug off advanced lasers with ease and its heavily armored skin requires powerful ballistics to pierce.
ent-SojournMobRenderMalformed = malformed render
    .desc = { ent-SojournMobRender.desc }
ent-SojournMobPanther = panther
    .desc = Runtime's larger, less cuddly cousin.
ent-SojournMobNightmareStalker = nightmare stalker
    .desc = Though physically imposing, it prefers to ambush its prey who draw close using its chameleonic chitin and sound mimicry.
ent-SojournMobDreamDaemon = dream daemon
    .desc = A creature of primal nightmares, bred in pitchest black... a rare sight of an evolved nightmare stalker, much deadlier, ruthless and agile than the average.
ent-SojournMobCroakerLord = croaker lord
    .desc = The thing the 'frogs' eventually grow into, proving beyond doubt their alien nature. While one of the strongest monsters on the planet it isn't normally hostile unless it has a reason, and god help you if it finds one.
ent-SojournMobHellPig = hell pig
    .desc = The venerable evolution of a tengolo charger, morphing into a violent and destructive beast hostile to all but its own berserk kind.
ent-SojournMobHellPigWendigo = wendigo
    .desc = The venerable evolution of a tengolo stalker, morphing into a violent and destructive beast hostile to all but its own berserk kind.
ent-SojournMobSlepnir = slepnir
    .desc = The venerable evolution of a tengolo charger. Unlike its other berserk kin, it only attacks those who draw close, but once its ire is drawn it becomes a relentless pursuer.
ent-SojournMobMukwah = mukwah
    .desc = A bear that escaped from the abandoned zoo labs before mutating into a creature known as a mukwah. Slow, but with a strength that exceeds even other powerful fauna.
ent-SojournMobChimera = chimera
    .desc = A mutated strain of a domesticated cerberus, rarely appearing and much sleeker than their lesser cousins. Prized companions by all hunters.

ent-SojournMobCaveSpider = cave spider
    .desc = Furry and white, it makes you shudder to look at it. This one has brilliant blue eyes and a pale cold body.
ent-SojournMobCloakerSpider = cloaker spider
    .desc = Furry and black, it makes you shudder to look at it. This one has a weaker chameleonic chitin that makes it hard to see.

ent-SojournMobElektromagnetischRoach = Elektromagnetisch roach
    .desc = A monstrous, dog-sized cockroach. This blue glowing one looks like it's pulsing with energy.
ent-SojournEffectRoachEmp = electromagnetic pulse
ent-SojournMobGestrahlteRoach = Gestrahlte roach
    .desc = A hulking beast of green, congealed waste. It has an enlarged salivary gland for vomiting toxic waste on enemies.
ent-SojournMobGluhendRoach = Gluhend roach
    .desc = A huge dog-sized roach that has evolved to produce small amounts of uranium in its gland, becoming stronger and glowing sickly green.
ent-SojournMobJagerRoach = Jager roach
    .desc = A monstrous, dog-sized cockroach. This one has bigger claws.
ent-SojournMobKraftwerkRoach = Kraftwerk roach
    .desc = A deformed mess of a roach that is covered in metallic outcrops and formations. It seems to have a production center on its thorax.
ent-SojournMobNaniteSwarm = nanite infested miniroach cluster
    .desc = A swarm of disgusting locusts infested with nanomachines.
ent-SojournPuddleNaniteOil = puddle
ent-SojournMobPanzerRoach = Panzer roach
    .desc = A monstrous, dog-sized cockroach. This one looks more robust than others.
ent-SojournMobTazntzRoach = Tazntz roach
    .desc = A mass of twitching and squirming limbs, the seemingly apparent abomination of a frog and roach melded together. It seems to despise all life, even its own.
ent-SojournMobUnbekanntRoach = Unbekannt roach
    .desc = This shimmering insectoid-like creature greatly resembles a giant cockroach. It flickers in and out of reality, as if it didn't really belong here.
ent-SojournActionRoachBlink = blink
fauna-sojourn-roach-screech = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} screeches!
fauna-sojourn-roach-bile = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} globs up some toxic bile all over {THE($target)}!
fauna-sojourn-roach-pinch = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} pinches hard, chemically burning {THE($target)}!
fauna-sojourn-roach-flash = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} flashes a bright green, blinding {THE($target)}!

ent-SojournMobAmeridianGolem = ameridian golem
    .desc = A weird creature made of ameridian.
ent-SojournMobAmeridianRuntling = ameridian runtling
    .desc = A weird creature made of ameridian. It is smaller and weaker, but numerous and fast.
ent-SojournMobAmeridianTitan = ameridian titan
    .desc = An incredible mass of rolling sheet rock and razor sharp ameridian fragments, it shambles about as red ameridian crystals glow and crack loudly around it.
ent-SojournProjectileAmeridianShard = ameridian shard
ent-SojournActionAmeridianShard = shard
fauna-sojourn-golem-shatter = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} shatters into a pile of rubble.
fauna-sojourn-titan-retort = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} punches {THE($target)} for trying to grab it!
ent-SojournMobKorolevaTermite = Koroleva termite
    .desc = A huge termite, the queen of a local brood, ready to crush anything it perceives as a threat to its hive.
ent-SojournMobPomoshchnikTermite = Pomoshchnik termite
    .desc = A termite that does the hard labor and odd jobs around its colony. Jeez... even termites have assistants.
ent-SojournMobPushkaTermite = Pushka termite
    .desc = A larger, scarier termite for when trouble brews.
ent-SojournMobSmertnikTermite = Smertnik termite
    .desc = A miner termite that has been hardened by the very surface beneath your feet.
ent-SojournProjectileSharpStone = sharp stone

ent-SojournMobCorruptedDevourer = corrupted devourer
    .desc = In the realm of other the other worldly deep maintenance, there are things which should not be. This creature is the result of what a mindless thought can create, familiar and yet entirely alien.
ent-SojournMobMemoryEater = memory eater
    .desc = A memory eater, named for the fact that it can devour your perception of it until its close enough to strike. Not that strong, compared to other monsters in this realm, but the most discrete.
ent-SojournMobPonderous = ponderous
    .desc = The ponderous, believed to be a mutation of local wild life, it stalks towards its prey slowly, its touch quite malignant, more so to psions than anyone else. Due to its thick carapace, it can absorb absurd amounts of punishment.
ent-SojournMobLicker = licker
    .desc = The licker, named for its long venom laced tongue. Some speculate that it was once an insect of some form, given its choice of venom, what is known is that while fast, it isn't that strong. Watch out for the fleshy pink thing it is to eager to touch you with.
ent-SojournMobCerebralCrusher = cerebral crusher
    .desc = A hulking creature of bone, powerful and ponderous in its strength, its claws are coated in toxins that weaken the mind, its touch draining and its ability to rend flesh, murderous.
ent-SojournMobFleshTower = flesh tower
    .desc = A billowing tower of flesh, oozing pus and acid. Thought to locate its targets psionically, though it seems incapable of seeing its own kind, often hitting and even killing them in its bid to end the lives of intruders in this realm. Something about this creature strikes you as familiar.
ent-SojournProjectilePsiGoo = electrolyzed goo
ent-SojournMobShellHound = shell hound
    .desc = A heavy plated hound, coated in bone armor, its exposed underbelly shows fleshy muscle, with no skin to cover it. Along its bone shell back are spines of mineral by the looks of it.
ent-SojournPsiAsh = strange ashes
    .desc = Something about these ashes feels off, as if an infinite potential exists within the dust.
ent-SojournPsiAshPonderous = strange ashes of ponderous
    .desc = { ent-SojournPsiAsh.desc }
fauna-sojourn-psi-crumble = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} looses a guttural snarl as it crumbles to dust!
ent-SojournMobPusMaggot = pus maggot
    .desc = Of all the things down here, the pus maggot is one of the most reviled, its tumorous squirming rear filled with a toxic and vile acid it tries to engorge onto its victims.
ent-SojournMobPusMaggotSummoned = { ent-SojournMobPusMaggot }
    .desc = { ent-SojournMobPusMaggot.desc }
ent-SojournMobHoveringNightmare = hovering nightmare
    .desc = The hovering nightmare is a flying creature resembling a misshapen skull. It is fast, remaining low to the ground and moving quickly through the use of psionics and will. Its bite is far worse than its bark.
ent-SojournMobMemory = memory
    .desc = We leave more than simply our mark where we die.
ent-SojournMobAshWendigo = ash wendigo
    .desc = Rage given form, agonized and seeking to punish others for its fate. With skull wreathed in fire, it comes for you.
ent-SojournMobBaronWormwood = Baron Wormwood
    .desc = He sings for meat, for piles and piles of flesh heaped onto a rotting table for his greedy maw to consume all manner of ripened offal.
ent-SojournPsiAshWeak = weak ashes
    .desc = Something about these ashes feels off, as if an infinite potential exists within the dust... but it is weaker feeling than normal.
ent-SojournPsiAshAshWendigo = strange ashes of ash wendigo
    .desc = Something about these ashes feels off, as if an infinite potential exists within the dust. Ashes to Ashes, Dust to Dust, the exists possable form folklore sooth even the dead.
ent-SojournPsiAshBehemoth = strange ashes of flesh behemoth
    .desc = { ent-SojournPsiAsh.desc }
fauna-sojourn-psi-maggot-pus = The pus maggot vomits up some acidic pus all over!
fauna-sojourn-psi-wendigo-fire = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} wreathes its claws in fire before striking!
fauna-sojourn-psi-baron-burst = Baron Wormwood heaves as his body crumbles, wriggling pus maggots bursting from its failing rotted bulk!
fauna-sojourn-king-phase-1 = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} looses a terrible scream before journeying to nowhere, his words bellowing in rage, "Only the king may wear the crown!" The answering calls of his court echo through the realm!
fauna-sojourn-king-phase-2 = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} looses an agonized howl before journeying to nowhere, his words bellowing in rage, "I will never die!" The strongest of his court heard, affirming his call!
ent-SojournMobCrimsonJelly = crimson jelly
    .desc = A genetic abomination left to rot, midway through the transformation into something far worse. The end result of horrible creatures left to gestate instead of being properly purged. It hungers for form and its body may spread its genetic instability, but at least through it, has weakened over time.
ent-SojournMobPitchHorror = pitch horror
    .desc = Left to fester, to grow, to mutate into a terrible thing of eyes and teeth. What never should have been, twisted into something unbearable to the minds of men. It comes and brings mutating horror in its wake. Only the light may halt its unnatural regeneration.
fauna-sojourn-psi-jelly-knock = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} uses its mass to knock over {THE($target)}!
fauna-sojourn-psi-jelly-burst = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} shrieks in its death as it violently bursts into a shower of gibs!
ent-SojournMobViscountMannimarcus = Viscount Mannimarcus
    .desc = His all seeing eye has let its gaze fall upon you.
ent-SojournMobDukeRavencroft = Duke Ravencroft
    .desc = He comes to protect his king. Is it out of loyalty or simply the chance to kill?
ent-SojournMobMarshalBenedictus = Marshal Benedictus
    .desc = He shall pry your secrets from your flesh and slice your mind to colorful bloodied ribbons.
ent-SojournMobRedJesterThomas = Red Jester Thomas
    .desc = He laughed, even at the end.
ent-SojournMobStewardKerevork = Steward Kerevork
    .desc = Enslavement.
ent-SojournMobDreamingKing = Dreaming King
    .desc = The Dreaming King, named by the first psion who saw it through a drug induced haze. Thought first to be merely the creation of a fever dream until sojourns into deep maintenance revealed him to be a nightmare come to life. Only one may live at any one time, the king of the other world roams deep maintenance and woe to anyone that would try to take his crown.
ent-SojournPsiAshKing = ashes of the throne bound tyrant
    .desc = He will be back.
ent-SojournMobDaskvey = Daskvey
    .desc = A lumbering dragon as dark as the void of space itself, large sheets of leathery wings furl behind its back, while its head looks on with its eyeless gaze, only sockets in place of normal eyes. It remains deep in thought in its squating position at all times, positivly streaming psionic energy to the entire area around it.
ent-SojournDaskveyBlast = electro-kinetic blast
ent-SojournProjectileDaskveyTail = tail lash
ent-SojournActionDaskveyFireBreath = fire breath
ent-SojournActionDaskveyTail = tail grapple
ent-SojournActionDaskveyBump = bump
ent-SojournActionMukwahRoar = roar
fauna-sojourn-king-arrive-1 = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} appears from thin air in a shower of gore, wounded and screaming in rage as his court answers his call!
fauna-sojourn-king-arrive-2 = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} appears from thin air in a shower of gore, heavily wounded and howling in agony as his court answers his call!
fauna-sojourn-daskvey-fire = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} has a firey look in its maw!
fauna-sojourn-daskvey-tail = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} flicks its tail and wings!

