fauna-emote-sojourn-hovering-nightmare-1 = begins to melt, blackened skin sloughing down its form until it pulls taut.
fauna-emote-sojourn-hovering-nightmare-2 = howls, "Birth, flesh, death, decay, birth, flesh, death, decay!"
fauna-emote-sojourn-hovering-nightmare-3 = howls in agony!
