fauna-emote-sojourn-memory-2 = howls, "They could have done something!"
fauna-emote-sojourn-memory-3 = whispers, "I could have done something..."
fauna-emote-sojourn-memory-4 = groans, "Kill me, please..."
fauna-emote-sojourn-memory-5 = weeps, "It will never end."
fauna-emote-sojourn-ash-wendigo-1 = crackles and pops as its head burns!
fauna-emote-sojourn-ash-wendigo-2 = looses a haunting scream!
fauna-emote-sojourn-ash-wendigo-3 = claws at its head, trying to put out the flames!
fauna-emote-sojourn-baron-wormwood-1 = chuckles lowly, split bleeding lips cracking into a pleased leer.
fauna-emote-sojourn-baron-wormwood-2 = murmurs, "So troubling, so troubling, more gore for the pile but they bring so many toys..."
fauna-emote-sojourn-baron-wormwood-3 = snorts, "Too many butchers, not enough bakers."
fauna-emote-sojourn-viscount-mannimarcus-1 = chitters in song.
fauna-emote-sojourn-viscount-mannimarcus-2 = rasps, "I told the King they would come, but his arrogance led to nothing being done."
fauna-emote-sojourn-viscount-mannimarcus-3 = sighs wearily, "We must be ever vigil."
fauna-emote-sojourn-duke-ravencroft-1 = growls quietly.
fauna-emote-sojourn-duke-ravencroft-2 = hisses, "The King is dead, long live the King."
fauna-emote-sojourn-duke-ravencroft-3 = yells, "Ashes! Ashes and dust, all of you!"
fauna-emote-sojourn-marshal-benedictus-1 = knocks a closed fist on his bone plates.
fauna-emote-sojourn-marshal-benedictus-2 = mutters, "They call themselves marshals, yet with no court? Hmph!"
fauna-emote-sojourn-marshal-benedictus-3 = grinds his knuckles along the ground, "Not a loss, not a loss at all."
fauna-emote-sojourn-red-jester-thomas-1 = laughs in a chorus of voices!
fauna-emote-sojourn-red-jester-thomas-2 = giggles madly!
fauna-emote-sojourn-red-jester-thomas-3 = howls with laughter!
fauna-emote-sojourn-steward-kerevork-1 = moans, "There was no escape."
fauna-emote-sojourn-steward-kerevork-2 = sighs, "I have no regrets, I went with a clear conscience."
fauna-emote-sojourn-steward-kerevork-3 = groans, "If only we could have forseen this."
fauna-emote-sojourn-dreaming-king-1 = smears its sticky claws along its shoulders.
fauna-emote-sojourn-dreaming-king-2 = bellows in a low voice, "Render unto the king all which you have."
fauna-emote-sojourn-dreaming-king-3 = intones, "Kneel before the crown."
fauna-emote-sojourn-dreaming-king-4 = repeats in a different voice, "He's completely insane. You see that, right? No care for the rules."
fauna-emote-sojourn-dreaming-king-5 = speaks loudly, "We meet again. Farewell."
fauna-emote-sojourn-dreaming-king-6 = yells loudly, "A taste of your former glory!"
